WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:09.840
Your son merely took it for drunken rambling. As Chancellor of the Imperial Academy, Yu Gong holds widespread renown; your son feared that arresting him rashly would damage Father's esteem among scholars across the realm.

00:11.080 --> 00:18.360
The esteem of scholars... the will of the nine provinces! Is that worn-out platitude all you know how to recite before me?!
